                "security-severity": "7.5"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The X.509 certificate with subject app.example.com expired on 2025-11-26 (362 days ago). Renew the certificate and automate renewal (e.g. ACME) with expiry monitoring. Document-based analysis: only the supplied file was examined. Deployed configuration may differ; the result reflects the file content at the recorded SHA-256."
              },
